  "note": "Same format as track01.json. A bonus Track, outside the set list: the home of TRACERS (design/modes/tracers.md). Character: disco house, the dance floor. E minor 9, A 13, D major 9, B minor 7: two, five, one, six, the first Track built on seventh chords, voiced close so one hand barely moves. Four on the floor with the open hat on every off-beat, the bass walking root, octave and fifth, piano stabs pushed ahead of the beat. The lead is a string line of chord tones only, a low note answered by a high one, so every second note alone (the auto-aim's) is still a tune. Nothing in it but chord tones and the scale: it stays sweet at any fire rate.",
